## 2️⃣ Recommended Improvements

| Area | Why it matters | How to improve (code) |
|------|----------------|-----------------------|
| **Configuration** | Hard‑coding values forces secrets into source control and prevents different environments (dev / prod). | Use `process.env.PORT` with a sensible fallback. |
