| Async safety (no async routes now, but you can add `express-async-errors` or `try/catch`) | Prevents unhandled promise rejections from crashing the process. |
| Example validation (`express-validator`) | Shows how to validate/sanitize any future user‑supplied data. |
| Graceful shutdown & unhandled‑exception listeners | Clean termination in containers and better observability. |

